SN  - 1471-2334
UR  - http://sk8es4mc2l.search.serialssolutions.com/?url_ver=Z39.88-2004&rft_val_fmt=info:ofi/fmt:kev:mtx:journal&rfr_id=info:sid/Ovid:med23&rft.genre=article&rft_id=info:doi/10.1186%2Fs12879-023-07987-6&rft_id=info:pmid/36690950&rft.issn=1471-2334&rft.volume=23&rft.issue=1&rft.spage=49&rft.pages=49&rft.date=2023&rft.jtitle=BMC+Infectious+Diseases&rft.atitle=Spatial+distribution+and+machine+learning+prediction+of+sexually+transmitted+infections+and+associated+factors+among+sexually+active+men+and+women+in+Ethiopia%2C+evidence+from+EDHS+2016.&rft.aulast=Kebede+Kassaw
