TI  - On-site illicit-drug detection with an integrated near-infrared spectral sensor: A proof of concept.
AU  - Kranenburg, Ruben F
AU  - Ou, Fang
AU  - Sevo, Petar
AU  - Petruzzella, Maurangelo
AU  - de Ridder, Renee
AU  - van Klinken, Anne
